@startuml diag-topo-part4

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #555555
}

title Topologie réseau --- Partie 4 : Politique de filtrage inter-VLAN\nRègles pfSense (deny-by-default)

node "pfSense CE\nFirewall inter-VLAN\nDeny-by-default" as PFSENSE #EDE7F6

node "VLAN 10\nZone IoT\n192.168.10.0/24" as V10 #E8F5E9
node "VLAN 20\nZone DMZ\n192.168.20.0/24" as V20 #FFF9C4
node "VLAN 30\nZone PKI\n192.168.30.0/24" as V30 #FCE4EC
node "VLAN 40\nZone SIEM\n192.168.40.0/24" as V40 #E3F2FD

V10 -right-> V20 : ACCEPT\nMQTT 8883/tcp
V10 -down->  V30 : ACCEPT\nVault API 8200/tcp
V20 -right-> V40 : ACCEPT\nSyslog 1514/tcp\nEVE JSON (Filebeat)
V30 -down->  V40 : ACCEPT\nWazuh agent 1514/tcp

V10 -[#CC0000,dashed]-> V40 : DROP (IoT → SIEM)
V20 -[#CC0000,dashed]-> V30 : DROP (DMZ → PKI direct)

note bottom of PFSENSE
  Règle implicite finale :
  any → any : DROP (deny-by-default)
  ——————————————————————————————
  Seuls les flux ci-dessus sont ACCEPT.
  Tout flux non listé est bloqué
  sans notification à la source.
end note

note top of V10
  Sources :
  fleet-simulator (.100)
  device-001..050 (.11–.60)
end note

note top of V20
  Hôtes :
  Mosquitto (.10) port 8883
  Suricata (.20) mode passif
end note

note bottom of V30
  Hôtes :
  Vault (.10) port 8200
  CA intermédiaire active
end note

note bottom of V40
  Hôtes :
  Wazuh Manager (.10)
  ML Engine (.20)
  OpenSearch (.10:9200)
  Dashboard (.10:5601)
end note

@enduml
